                <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.98] text-slate-900">Best No Credit Check Bank Accounts to Build Credit in 2026</h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] md:text-[18px] leading-7 text-slate-500 max-w-[720px]">You can open a bank account without a credit check and still build credit — if the account reports your payments to the credit bureaus. Here are the 5 best options for 2026, compared by fees, bureau reporting, and approval with no SSN or ITIN.</p>

                <!-- Author Box -->
                <div class="mt-8 rounded-[16px] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-4 md:p-5 flex gap-4 items-start">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[16px] flex-shrink-0">AS</div>
