                            <span class="text-[12px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">✓ Fact-checked</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-5 mt-1">Former CFPB analyst focused on fair lending and depository products. Specializes in second-chance banking and credit builder compliance.</p>
                        <div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-slate-500"><span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border flex items-center justify-center font-bold">JL</span><span><b class="text-slate-900">Reviewed by Dr. James L., CFA</b> · CFA Charterholder, credit risk & E-E-A-T reviewer · Oct 20, 2026</span></div>
